  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint) | devDependencies | minor | [`1.10.2` -> `1.11.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@typescript-eslint%2feslint-plugin/1.10.2/1.11.0) |\n| [@typescript-eslint/parser](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint) | devDependencies | minor | [`1.10.2` -> `1.11.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@typescript-eslint%2fparser/1.10.2/1.11.0) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint</summary>\n\n### [`v1.11.0`](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1110httpsgithubcomtypescript-eslinttypescript-eslintcomparev1102v1110-2019-06-23)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/compare/v1.10.2...v1.11.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **eslint-plugin:** [no-magic-numbers] add support for enums ([#&#8203;543](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/543)) ([5c40d01](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/5c40d01))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** [promise-function-async] allow any as return value ([#&#8203;553](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/553)) ([9a387b0](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/9a387b0))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** Remove duplicated code ([#&#8203;611](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/611)) ([c4df4ff](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/c4df4ff))\n-   **parser:** add simpleTraverse, replaces private ESLint util ([#&#8203;628](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/628)) ([aa206c4](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/aa206c4))\n-   **typescript-estree:** fix more cases with double slash in JSX text ([#&#8203;607](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/607)) ([34cfa53](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/34cfa53))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **eslint-plugin:** [no-explicit-any] ignoreRestArgs ([#&#8203;548](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/548)) ([753ad75](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/753ad75))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** add `consistent-type-definitions` rule ([#&#8203;463](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/463)) ([ec87d06](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/ec87d06))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** add new rule no-empty-function ([#&#8203;626](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/626)) ([747bfcb](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/747bfcb))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** add new rule no-floating-promises ([#&#8203;495](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/495)) ([61e6385](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/61e6385))\n\n#### [1.10.2](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/compare/v1.10.1...v1.10.2) (2019-06-10)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **eslint-plugin:** peerDep should specify semver major range ([#&#8203;602](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/602)) ([5589938](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/5589938))\n\n#### [1.10.1](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/compare/v1.10.0...v1.10.1) (2019-06-09)\n\n**Note:** Version bump only for package [@&#8203;typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about these updates again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
